<h1>{{title}}</h1>
<p>
  This page is a plain <code>@Render</code> route. Nestvexa adds Handlebars and
  Live endpoints without replacing Nest routing, guards, pipes, interceptors or
  exception filters.
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <code>GET /api/notes/:id</code>: API-key guard, <code>ParseIntPipe</code>,
    envelope interceptor, error filter.
  </li>
  <li><code>POST /api/notes</code>: a body validation pipe.</li>
  <li><code>GET /api/health</code>: names the active platform.</li>
</ul>
